  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>At&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msqrt></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>256</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
